image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4d/Talent_Awakened_By_the_Baying_Hounds.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034032\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Awakened By the Baying Hounds\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4d/Talent_Awakened_By_the_Baying_Hounds.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034032\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4d/Talent_Awakened_By_the_Baying_Hounds.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034032 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4d/Talent_Awakened_By_the_Baying_Hounds.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034032 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Awakened By the Baying Hounds\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Awakened_By_the_Baying_Hounds.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Awakened By the Baying Hounds.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alyosha\" title=\"Alyosha\">Alyosha</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Tugarin</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Tugarin</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Alyosha's trusted hunting hound and companion, which can be summoned to the field using the Elemental Burst Hunter's Advance.<br />Periodically moves close to an opponent to maul them, and activate any existing Hunter's Marks.</span></span></span> attacks, it will also restore HP to nearby active characters at 120% of Alyosha's ATK.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Awakened By the Baying Hounds</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Alyosha\" title=\"Alyosha\">Alyosha</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2